{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e05-scene-09",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "目がダメなら耳だ  (If the Eyes Are Blocked, Aim for the Ears)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "toshi": "トシ",
    "kawada": "川田"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Marveling at Kuroki's blend of innocent poise and fearless candor, Kawada and Toshi remind Muranishi that no shop can carry the tape unless it obeys the commission's thick-mosaic rule. Listen to Muranishi, Kawada, and Toshi in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "不思議な魅力の子だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ確かにな、幼い顔して大胆つーか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でも、委員会の規制を守らないかぎり作品は出せませんよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そうなんだよ、モザイクの規定は守らねえと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それはなあ、あえて乗ってやろうかと思ってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何か考えが？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "バカが作ったルールをアイデアで乗り越えればいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "どうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "目がダメなら耳だ。トシ、笛を買ってきてくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "は？笛？もうちょっと説明してくれよ、どんな笛だよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前に任せるから、とにかく早く急いで用意してくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "もう分かったよ…笛…",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "不思議な魅力の子だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is a young woman with an extraordinary, mysterious allure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ確かにな、幼い顔して大胆つーか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, no kidding — innocent-faced yet astonishingly bold.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でも、委員会の規制を守らないかぎり作品は出せませんよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even so, unless we abide by the commission's regulations, we won't be able to release the film.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そうなんだよ、モザイクの規定は守らねえと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He's right — we've got no choice except following their mosaic rules.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それはなあ、あえて乗ってやろうかと思ってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On that score, I'm actually thinking of playing right along with their rule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何か考えが？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have a plan in mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "バカが作ったルールをアイデアで乗り越えればいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We simply vault over rules made by fools using a better idea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "どうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how are you gonna pull that off?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "目がダメなら耳だ。トシ、笛を買ってきてくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If the eyes are off-limits, we aim for the ears. Toshi, go buy me a whistle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "は？笛？もうちょっと説明してくれよ、どんな笛だよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh?! A whistle?! Give me a little more explanation — what kind of whistle?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前に任せるから、とにかく早く急いで用意してくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I leave the choice up to you, just hurry and get one here fast.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "もう分かったよ…笛…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, alright, I get it... a whistle...'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "不思議な魅力の子だ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ確かにな、幼い顔して大胆つーか。",
      "gap": 0.5
